<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling stable against dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling stable against dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling remained stable against the dollar and the pound on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Commercial dealers said the shilling was dealt at a mean rate of 590.4261 versus the dollar versus 590.4558 on Monday, the central Bank of Tanzania said.</p>
<p>Against the pound, the shilling was dealt at a commercial mean of 918.8831 compared to 918.1027 on Monday.</p>
</text>
